{"seq":3,"slug":"automation-value-measurement","title":"自动化价值量与社会必要劳动时间度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/marxism/political-economy-ai-automation/automation-labour-value/automation-value-measurement","wordCount":3163,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动化价值量与社会必要劳动时间度量\">自动化价值量与社会必要劳动时间度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>社会必要劳动时间（socially necessary labour time, SNLT）是马克思价值论的度量基石：商品价值不取决于个别生产者实际耗费的劳动，而取决于在现有社会正常生产条件、平均劳动熟练程度和劳动强度下生产该商品所需的劳动时间。度量 SNLT 的困难在于它既是<strong>规范概念</strong>（一个经济体的价值尺度），又必须从<strong>可观测量</strong>（价格、投入产出、工时、工资）中反推。自动化把这一困难推到前沿：机器大规模替代活劳动时单位商品价值量下降，但&quot;社会必要&quot;的基准线本身随自动化投资而移动，度量须同时追踪产出价值与重置基准。</p>\n<p>马克思在《资本论》第一卷中给出了度量的定性判据：决定价值量的是社会必要劳动时间，而非个别劳动时间；劳动生产率提高会降低单位商品价值量。自动化是劳动生产率提高的极端形式。把这一判据变成可计算、可检验的度量，需要选择一条&quot;估值路径&quot;，这正是马克思主义价值计量争论的核心。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[自动化投资] --&gt; B[资本有机构成 c/v 上升]&#10;    B --&gt; C[活劳动投入下降]&#10;    A --&gt; E[社会正常生产条件重置]&#10;    E --&gt; F[社会必要劳动时间基准线上移]&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[单位商品价值量下降]&#10;    C --&gt; G[剩余价值率 e=s/v 变化]&#10;    G --&gt; H[利润来源的度量分歧]&#10;    D --&gt; I[价格-价值偏离]&#10;    I --&gt; J[经验度量的核心难题]\">graph TD\n    A[自动化投资] --&gt; B[资本有机构成 c/v 上升]\n    B --&gt; C[活劳动投入下降]\n    A --&gt; E[社会正常生产条件重置]\n    E --&gt; F[社会必要劳动时间基准线上移]\n    F --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[单位商品价值量下降]\n    C --&gt; G[剩余价值率 e=s/v 变化]\n    G --&gt; H[利润来源的度量分歧]\n    D --&gt; I[价格-价值偏离]\n    I --&gt; J[经验度量的核心难题]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>估值路径</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>计量工具</th>\n<th>对自动化的处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>劳动价值（LTV）</td>\n<td>价值 = 物化劳动 + 活劳动</td>\n<td>投入产出劳动系数</td>\n<td>机器按含劳动计算，自动化不改变总价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>斯拉法/新李嘉图</td>\n<td>价格由工资-利润分配决定</td>\n<td>标准商品、价格方程组</td>\n<td>否定独立价值量，度量退化为价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单一体系解释（TSSI）</td>\n<td>价值由历史成本与货币决定</td>\n<td>时序货币量、MELT</td>\n<td>自动化体现为 MELT 变动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经验转向（IWGVT）</td>\n<td>由实际 I-O 数据反算价值</td>\n<td>世界投入产出数据库</td>\n<td>用可观测劳动流锚定价值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"度量基准-社会必要劳动时间如何被自动化重置\">度量基准：社会必要劳动时间如何被自动化重置</h2><p>社会必要劳动时间不是某个车间里的钟表时间，而是一条<strong>重置线</strong>：由该行业在正常技术条件下、以平均熟练度和强度生产同类商品所需的劳动决定。自动化改变的不是某个企业的工时，而是整条重置线。当一家电商仓库部署自动分拣系统后，单位订单的直接人工从数十分钟降至数分钟，行业内的&quot;正常条件&quot;随之移动，未能自动化的企业即使工时未变，其个别价值也高于社会价值。</p>\n<p>这一机制可用一个比值刻画。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 为单位产出所含的社会必要劳动时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>direct</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{direct}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">direct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为活劳动投入（人时），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>indirect</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{indirect}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">indirect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为由机器、设备、软件等物化劳动还原得到的劳动当量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为产出量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>direct</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>indirect</mtext></msub></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = \\frac{L_{\\text{direct}} + L_{\\text{indirect}}}{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">direct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">indirect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>自动化降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>direct</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{direct}}/Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">direct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，但物化劳动在总价值中的比重上升。单位商品价值量下降，幅度取决于物化劳动的还原方式。这里的关键是<strong>还原率</strong>（reduction coefficient）问题：一台自动化设备的价值，由生产它所需的直接与间接劳动决定，并按折旧年限分摊到每单位产出。自动化越深，间接劳动链条越长，度量对投入产出表完整性和折旧假设越敏感。</p>\n<p>自动化对重置线的影响还是持续的：折旧周期、技术换代和软件的边际零成本复制，使&quot;正常条件&quot;移动快于传统制造业。度量因此必须明确时间窗口——用单一时点的横截面数据锚定 SNLT，会系统性高估落后技术、低估前沿技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从投入产出表反算价值-经验方法及其局限\">从投入产出表反算价值：经验方法及其局限</h2><p>当代最有影响力的价值度量方法，是<strong>经验转向</strong>（empirical turn）下的投入产出法：用世界投入产出数据库（WIOD）或经合组织（OECD）的跨国投入产出表（ICIO）记录各部门间的中间投入流，再结合就业与工时数据，解算直接与间接劳动系数。</p>\n<p>数学上，把投入产出表写成矩阵形式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为直接消耗系数矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{l}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 为各部门单位总产出所需的直接劳动系数向量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\lambda} = \\mathbf{l}\\,(\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{A})^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">λ</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathbf{I}-\\mathbf{A})^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是列昂惕夫逆矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 部门单位产出蕴含的全部社会必要劳动时间。该法被广泛用于分析国际贸易中的<strong>价值转移</strong>：出口国投入的劳动与最终在进口国实现的价值之间的差额。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库/来源</th>\n<th>维护机构</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WIOD</td>\n<td>荷兰格罗宁根大学</td>\n<td>全球投入产出，劳动价值经验研究的经典数据源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OECD ICIO</td>\n<td>经济合作与发展组织</td>\n<td>跨国投入产出，覆盖更近年份、含数字部门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXIOBASE</td>\n<td>欧盟研究联盟</td>\n<td>环境-经济扩展投入产出，可同时算劳动与能耗系数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ILOSTAT</td>\n<td>国际劳工组织</td>\n<td>就业与工时，提供劳动系数所需的工时口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这一方法的力量在于可复现：任何人用同一张投入产出表和同一套解算规则，都能重算出劳动价值。它对自动化的处理统一而朴素——自动化设备的价值被还原为生产设备的上游劳动。因此结论往往&quot;稳定&quot;：即便某环节高度自动化，其物化劳动仍可追溯到制造设备的劳动，即&quot;自动化不消灭价值，只转移价值来源&quot;。</p>\n<p>局限同样明确。第一，<strong>还原率假设</strong>：投入产出表按价格记账，隐含&quot;价格与价值成比例&quot;的强假设，对价格-价值偏离大的部门（如软件、金融、品牌）误差大。第二，<strong>线性化</strong>：列昂惕夫逆矩阵是线性的，而自动化常伴随规模报酬递增和边际零成本。第三，<strong>工时口径</strong>：ILOSTAT 按人头或工时统计，劳动强度与技能差异未被完全折算，会低估高强度部门。第四，<strong>数据滞后</strong>：官方投入产出表通常滞后二到三年，而自动化换代以月计，度量永远在追赶已移动的基准线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有机构成与剩余价值率-自动化下的度量分歧\">有机构成与剩余价值率：自动化下的度量分歧</h2><p>自动化最直接的度量后果，是<strong>资本有机构成</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c/v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的上升——不变资本（机器、设备、原料）相对可变资本（工资）的比重增加。围绕这一上升是否改变价值创造，马克思主义内部形成了尖锐分歧，焦点正是&quot;如何度量自动化下的价值量&quot;。</p>\n<p>设剩余价值率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e = s/v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 为剩余价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 为可变资本。利润率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 可写为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = \\frac{s}{c+v} = \\frac{e}{c/v + 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8769em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0436em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>该式表明：即便剩余价值率因自动化而上升，只要资本有机构成上升更快，利润率仍趋于下降——这就是马克思的利润率下降趋势（tendency of the rate of profit to fall, TRPF）。度量这一趋势需分别估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，而三者口径依赖对价值量的处理方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>学派</th>\n<th>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的度量口径</th>\n<th>对自动化下 TRPF 的判断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统（正统）解读</td>\n<td>按当期价值估价投入</td>\n<td>有机构成上升导致 TRPF，长期趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同时决定（TSSI）</td>\n<td>投入按历史成本，产出按当期价值</td>\n<td>TRPF 是货币层面可观测现象，需时序数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新李嘉图/斯拉法</td>\n<td>用价格而非价值计量，否定独立 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>利润率由分配与技术进步共同决定，无必然下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经验 IWGVT</td>\n<td>用实际 I-O 数据近似价值量</td>\n<td>结论依赖数据库与部门加总，无统一答案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>度量分歧的实践后果很具体。用<strong>当期价值</strong>估价固定资本，人为压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（自动化设备贬值快），会低估有机构成上升；用<strong>历史成本</strong>估价，把过去投资按原价计入，高估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。同一批自动化投资在两种口径下会得出相反的 TRPF 结论。可核验的做法是：披露估价口径与折旧方法（直线法或几何法），并报告结果对口径的敏感性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字与-ai-部门的度量难题-边际零成本与无形资本\">数字与 AI 部门的度量难题：边际零成本与无形资本</h2><p>把上述方法用于 AI 与数字部门时，出现一类结构性难题：<strong>边际复制成本趋近于零</strong>。一份训练好的模型权重、一段软件、一条平台算法，可以零成本复制无数份。传统劳动价值论中，单位商品价值量随产出增加而下降，但数字产品在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，现实中却仍有可观价格。这一背离迫使度量分离三件事：<strong>首次创作劳动</strong>（训练、编码、设计的一次性投入）、<strong>摊销规则</strong>（一次性投入如何分摊到多期多份产出）、<strong>租金</strong>（价格中超出劳动价值的部分）。</p>\n<p>以大型语言模型的训练为例，其成本主要由算力（GPU 机时）、数据标注劳动、工程劳动和电力构成，高度前置且不确定（后续微调与推理不断追加），收入则来自 API 调用、订阅或捆绑。用投入产出法度量时，训练投入应作为<strong>固定资本形成</strong>计入当期再按服务年限摊销；但多数云厂商把大额算力支出费用化或按短年限折旧，价值度量与会计口径因此不一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数字部门特征</th>\n<th>传统制造业假设</th>\n<th>度量后果</th>\n<th>可行处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>边际复制成本 ≈ 0</td>\n<td>边际成本随产量递增</td>\n<td>单价无法反映单位劳动</td>\n<td>分离首次劳动与摊销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无形资本占比高</td>\n<td>固定资本以有形设备为主</td>\n<td>投入产出表低估资本存量</td>\n<td>引入无形资本卫星账户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格含垄断租金</td>\n<td>价格趋近价值</td>\n<td>高估该部门劳动价值</td>\n<td>用租金剥离或加价率校正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对跨境电商与自动化工程而言，这一难题并不抽象。一家用 AI 生成商品文案、图片与定价的平台，其&quot;产品&quot;的边际复制成本近乎为零，但支撑它的算力、模型、标注与合规劳动都是真实的社会必要劳动投入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    T[算力GPU机时] --&gt; M[模型训练]&#10;    D[数据标注劳动] --&gt; M&#10;    E[工程与合规劳动] --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; P1[平台自有成本]&#10;    M --&gt; P2[外部模型供应商]&#10;    P2 --&gt; V1[记录在上游部门]&#10;    P1 --&gt; V2[平台单位价值]&#10;    P1 --&gt; R[垄断租金]&#10;    V2 --&gt; W[摊销到每期每份产出]\">graph LR\n    T[算力GPU机时] --&gt; M[模型训练]\n    D[数据标注劳动] --&gt; M\n    E[工程与合规劳动] --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; P1[平台自有成本]\n    M --&gt; P2[外部模型供应商]\n    P2 --&gt; V1[记录在上游部门]\n    P1 --&gt; V2[平台单位价值]\n    P1 --&gt; R[垄断租金]\n    V2 --&gt; W[摊销到每期每份产出]</pre><p>经验度量还须回答<strong>训练劳动的归属</strong>：若平台把模型能力外部化给上游供应商，价值就记录在供应商所在部门，平台账面利润中相当部分是租金而非自身劳动创造，这既影响部门加总，也影响价值转移的方向判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>社会必要劳动时间既是规范概念，又必须从价格、投入产出、工时等可观测量反推；自动化使这一反推同时追踪产出价值与基准线重置两个移动目标。</li>\n<li>自动化重置的是&quot;社会正常生产条件&quot;这条基准线，而非某个企业的工时；未跟进自动化的企业其个别价值高于社会价值。</li>\n<li>经验价值度量以投入产出法为主，用列昂惕夫逆矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\lambda}=\\mathbf{l}(\\mathbf{I}-\\mathbf{A})^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">λ</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 WIOD、OECD ICIO 等数据库解算直接与间接劳动系数，可复现但有还原率、线性化、工时口径与数据滞后四重局限。- 资本有机构成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c/v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 上升与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=e/(c/v+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 使利润率趋势高度依赖估价口径：当期价值与历史成本会得出相反的 TRPF 结论，规范做法是披露口径并报告敏感性。</li>\n<li>数字与 AI 部门的边际零成本、无形资本与垄断租金，逼迫度量分离首次创作劳动、摊销规则与租金，并处理训练劳动在平台与模型供应商间的归属。</li>\n<li>度量结论没有唯一答案，但可核验的度量必须说明数据来源、部门加总、估价与折旧方法，并报告口径敏感性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动化价值量与社会必要劳动时间度量","id":"自动化价值量与社会必要劳动时间度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"度量基准：社会必要劳动时间如何被自动化重置","id":"度量基准-社会必要劳动时间如何被自动化重置"},{"level":2,"text":"从投入产出表反算价值：经验方法及其局限","id":"从投入产出表反算价值-经验方法及其局限"},{"level":2,"text":"有机构成与剩余价值率：自动化下的度量分歧","id":"有机构成与剩余价值率-自动化下的度量分歧"},{"level":2,"text":"数字与 AI 部门的度量难题：边际零成本与无形资本","id":"数字与-ai-部门的度量难题-边际零成本与无形资本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AI 生产率与剩余价值占有机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/marxism/political-economy-ai-automation/automation-labour-value/ai-surplus-value-appropriation"},"next":{"title":"数据作为生产资料与要素产权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/marxism/political-economy-ai-automation/ai-capital-accumulation/data-as-means-of-production"}}